                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Housing, healthcare, and energy costs are skyrocketing across Virginia \u2014 but rather than stand up to Trump and his reckless policies, @winwithwinsome praises him.\n\nI\u2019m running for Governor to put Virginia families \u2014 not Trump \u2014 first.",
