                "retweet_count": 35,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Wherever I go in Virginia, I hear from families struggling to keep up with rising costs. It\u2019s the #1 issue I hear about.\n\nThat\u2019s why, as Governor, lowering costs \u2014 from housing, to healthcare, to energy \u2014 will be my #1 focus.",
