                "retweet_count": 58,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In Congress, I worked to cap the cost of insulin at just $35/month. We provided incredible relief for Virginians on Medicare who rely on insulin every day.\n\nI\u2019ve cut healthcare costs for Virginians before \u2014 and I\u2019ll do it again as your next Governor.",
