                "reply_count": 261,
                "retweet_count": 31,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As Governor, I\u2019ll take real action to lower healthcare costs across the Commonwealth. \n\nMy Affordable Virginia Plan will crack down on PBMs driving up the costs of drugs, improve affordable healthcare options in our rural communities, and stop predatory billing practices.",
