                "retweet_count": 55,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Virginia, as your next Governor, I\u2019ll get to work on Day One to tackle the most pressing issue that Virginians are facing \u2014 rising costs.\n\nFrom housing, to healthcare, to energy, I\u2019ll work to lower costs and make life easier for Virginians across the Commonwealth.",
