                "retweet_count": 42,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Across Virginia, I hear from too many families who have to choose between paying for their lifesaving medication or putting food on the table.\n\nThat\u2019s unacceptable. As Governor, I\u2019ll work tirelessly to lower healthcare costs across the Commonwealth.",
