                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Contraception is a fundamental part of reproductive healthcare \u2014 yet my opponent voted against protecting the right to birth control.\n\nVirginia \u2014 as Governor, I will sign the Right to Contraception Act into law.",
