                "text": "In the past 48 hours, I traveled from Norfolk to Norton \u2014 and I\u2019m hearing the same thing from Virginians on opposite sides of the Commonwealth: they\u2019re worried about costs.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m laser-focused on lowering costs \u2014 from housing, to healthcare, to energy.",
